option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=Makes bright objects glow. Performance impact: §6High
option.BLOOM_CURVE=Bloom Curve
option.BLOOM_CURVE.comment=Controls how much dim pixels contribute to the bloom compared to bright ones
option.BORDER_FOG=Border Fog
option.BORDER_FOG.comment=Smoothly hides chunks near the end of your render distance. Performance impact: §2Minimal
option.BORDER_FOG_STRENGTH=Border Fog Strength
option.BORDER_FOG_FALLOFF=Border Fog Falloff
option.ATMOSPHERIC_FOG=Atmospheric Fog
option.ATMOSPHERIC_FOG.comment=Adds height-based fog in the morning, at night, and during rain. Performance impact: §2Minimal
