option.RAIN_TILT_STRENGTH=Rain Tilt Strength
option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud Style
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Choose a cloud style. "Vanilla" uses standard clouds, and you need to enable clouds in the game settings for them. Performance impact: §aLow §r(Volumetric: §cHigh§r)
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_DISTANCE=Vanilla Cloud Distance
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_DISTANCE.comment=Controls the render distance of standard clouds. Only works on 1.21.6+ (older versions use render distance)
option.WAVY_PLANTS=Waving Plants
option.WAVY_PLANTS.comment=Makes vegetation sway in the wind. Performance impact: §2Minimal
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Controls the brightness of the scene.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Controls the colorfulness of the image. A value of 0 makes everything gray, and a value of 2 turns the game into a clickbait YouTube video.
option.VIBRANCE=Vibrance
option.VIBRANCE.comment=Same as saturation, but has less effect on bright colors
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.CONTRAST.comment=Controls the sharpness of differences between dark and light colors
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTS=Handheld Lights
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTS.comment=Illuminates the area around you if you're holding a light-emitting block. Performance impact: §2Minimal
option.STAR_SIZE=Star Size
option.STAR_STRENGTH=Star Brightness
