option.TAA_MODE=Temporal Anti-Aliasing (TAA)
option.TAA_MODE.comment=Enables TAA — an algorithm that smooths jagged edges and improves the quality of some effects. "Super Resolution" mode provides image quality comparable to 2x render scaling. Performance impact: §aLow§f ("Fancy" mode: §eMedium§f)
option.TAA_BLEND_FACTOR=TAA Blend Factor
option.TAA_BLEND_FACTOR.comment=Controls how much previous frames affect the current one. High values give more blur, low values give more aliasing.
option.TAA_OFFCENTER_REJECTION=TAA Off-Center Rejection
option.TAA_OFFCENTER_REJECTION.comment=Reduces ghosting, especially during movement.
option.SMAA=SMAA
option.SMAA.comment=Alternative anti-aliasing method. For best results, set "Temporal Anti-Aliasing" to "Off" or "Denoise Only". Performance impact: §aLow§f
option.SMAA_THRESHOLD=SMAA Contrast Threshold
option.SMAA_THRESHOLD.comment=How much a pixel must "stand out" to be smoothed. Low values give more blur.
option.SMAA_SEARCH_DISTANCE=SMAA Search Distance
option.SMAA_SEARCH_DISTANCE.comment=How far to search for the ends of the current edge.
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING=Image Sharpening
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING.comment=Applies AMD CAS to the image. Performance impact: §aLow§f
option.SHARPENING=Sharpening Strength
option.ENCHANT_GLINT_OPACITY=Enchantment Glint Opacity
option.ROUND_SUN=Round Sun and Moon
option.VIGNETTE_FALLOFF=Vignette Falloff
option.VIGNETTE_FALLOFF.comment=Makes the vignette more pronounced at the edges of the screen
option.VIGNETTE_OPACITY=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE_OPACITY.comment=Darkens the edges of the screen, giving a more dramatic look.
option.SSAO=Ambient Occlusion (SSAO)
option.SSAO.comment=Darkens blocks based on their exposure to ambient light. §c§lEnable anti-aliasing to significantly improve the look of this effect. §rPerformance impact: §eMedium
option.SSAO_STRENGTH=AO Strength
option.SSAO_SCALE=AO Scale
option.SSAO_SCALE.comment=Controls the distance between samples for SSAO. Larger values create more artifacts.
