option.DOF_SHOW_FOCUS=Show Focus
option.DYNAMIC_SHADOWS=Dynamic Shadows
option.DYNAMIC_SHADOWS.comment=Uses a shadow map to cast shadows depending on the sun's position. Performance impact: §4EXTREME
option.SHADOW_FILTER=Shadow Filter
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Slightly blurs shadows to make jagged edges less noticeable. "Auto" uses PCF at higher shadow map resolutions where needed.
option.PCF_STRENGTH=PCF Strength
option.PCF_STRENGTH.comment=How much the PCF filter should blur shadows.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Map Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Please set "Shadow Filter" to PCF when using a high resolution. Performance impact: §6High
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS=Entity Shadows
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Whether entities should cast shadows. Can cause severe lag on large bases.
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS=Block Entity Shadows
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Whether block entities (chests, dispensers, signs, etc.) should cast shadows. Can cause severe lag on large bases.
option.entityShadowDistanceMul=Entity Shadow Distance
option.entityShadowDistanceMul.comment=§cIris only, not Optifine!!!. §fReduces entity shadow distance to reduce lag.
option.PBR_NORMAL=Normal Texture
option.PBR_NORMAL.comment=Uses the normal texture to make blocks "volumetric".
option.PBR_SPECULAR=Specular Texture
option.PBR_SPECULAR.comment=Uses the specular texture to make blocks "shiny". Also used for materials that emit or transmit light.
option.PBR_SPECULAR_RP_REFLECTIONS=Resource Pack Reflections
option.PBR_SPECULAR_RP_REFLECTIONS_THRESHOLD=RP Reflections Threshold
option.PBR_SPECULAR_RP_REFLECTIONS_THRESHOLD.comment=Lower this value if materials that should be reflective are not receiving reflections.
option.ROUGH_REFLECTIONS=Rough Reflections
option.PBR_POM=POM
option.PBR_POM.comment=Enables Parallax Occlusion Mapping — a technique that extends normal mapping and makes the "3D" effect more convincing. Performance impact: §6High
option.PBR_POM_STEPS=Parallax Steps
option.PBR_POM_MAX_DEPTH=Max Parallax Depth
option.POM_SHADOWING=Parallax Shadows
option.PBR_INFORMATION=Information (hover to read)
option.PBR_INFORMATION.comment=The features below require a resource pack supporting the labPBR 1.3 standard to work correctly. Such resource packs contain additional information that shaders can use: how reflective a block should be, how much light it emits, etc.
option.COLOR_BALANCING=Color Balancing
option.COLOR_BALANCING.comment=Advanced color correction tool that changes color hues based on their brightness
option.CHANNEL_MIXER=Channel Mixer
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION=Chromatic Aberration
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION.comment=Imitates the separation of light wavelengths at the edge of a lens — a common camera artifact
option.CA_STRENGTH=CA Strength
option.PBR_SSS_STRENGTH=Subsurface Scattering
option.PBR_SSS_STRENGTH.comment=Controls how much materials (e.g., foliage, vegetation) should scatter light within themselves. §cRequires 'Terrain & Lighting' -> 'Dynamic Shadows'
option.SEASONS=Seasons
option.SEASONS.comment=Changes vegetation colors according to real seasons. By default, each season lasts 30 in-game days
option.SEASONS_TEMPERATE_BIOME_CHECK=Temperate Biomes Only
option.SEASONS_TEMPERATE_BIOME_CHECK.comment=Excludes biomes that are too cold or too hot for season changes (e.g., savanna, taiga). This option will not work correctly with some resource packs.
option.OUTLINE=Outline
option.OUTLINE.comment=Adds cartoon-like outlines around block edges
option.OUTLINE_THICKNESS=Outline Thickness
option.OUTLINE_THRESHOLD=Outline Threshold
option.OUTLINE_THRESHOLD.comment=How sensitive edge detection should be
option.OUTLINE_BRIGHTNESS=Outline Brightness
option.END_FOG=End Fog
option.END_FOG_START_HEIGHT=End Fog Start Height
option.PUDDLES=Puddles
option.PUDDLES.comment=Adds puddles after rain. Performance impact: §eMedium
option.PUDDLE_COVERAGE=Puddle Coverage

